OL,3,GNEWSANew regulation for heating oil
OL,4,Amarket, but no price controls
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome heating oil suppliers in Northern
OL,7,FIreland will face stricter regulation
OL,8,Fin the wake of an inquiry by the UK's
OL,9,Fcompetition watchdog.
OL,11,FHowever it will not include the sort of
OL,12,Fprice controls applied to the gas and
OL,13,Felectricity markets.
OL,15,FThe Competition and Markets Authority
OL,16,F(CMA) investigated the heating oil
OL,17,Fmarket in Northern Ireland and other
OL,18,Fparts of the UK.
OL,20,FThe Economy Minister Caoimhe Archibald
OL,21,Fsaid she will now act on the CMA's
OL,22,Frecommendations.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
